      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Tripura features a rich river system that predominantly flows into Bangladesh.",
        "Dumbur Lake serves as a major reservoir and ecological hub created on the Gumti River.",
        "Rudrasagar Lake in South Tripura is a prominent natural wetland of ecological significance.",
        "The state experiences a tropical monsoon climate characterized by heavy seasonal rainfall and high humidity."
